      "content": "idk that feels like a lot of work. honestly it just feels exhausting trying to force people to care. like why should i have to perform or \"shine\" just to prove i'm alive? it's easier to just... not try. to just let the feeling of being a ghost happen. it feels more natural than fighting it.",
